{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/making_screen_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:26:47.046739Z","id":"665bec2397203bd0754662012fd521ab9f10853618c73e215d51a277b455dd85","body":{"detail":"MakingLog._progress keeps html when a PartialFile is shorter than what is shown (lib/ui/making_screen.dart:201-206). The shots test streams PartialFile('index.html', 'early') then 'mid' with no step between, so target/flutter-app/u1/making-3-mid-*.png repeat page-early-*.png and the mid page is never rendered.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":142},"end":{"line":144},"content_hash":"a777b128b5396175b57b5172cd63cf68fd48c35e62babb0b192a5698eec6b900"},"suggested_fix":"Key the fake frames by texts that grow (for example 'early' and 'middle').","summary":"The '3-mid' render shows the early frame: the fake text 'mid' is shorter than 'early', so MakingLog holds it as a shrink","tags":["review","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/launcher_icons_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:38:13.492042Z","id":"a9e388ee04978030f1981da6b40d2e3170ba581bb30a3e339b0ac06c9ca0c267","body":{"detail":"flutter_test sets debugDisableShadows = true, and RenderPhysicalShape then strokes each elevated shape in black at elevation * 2 (flutter/lib/src/rendering/proxy_box.dart:2216-2224 in the installed SDK). The extended FAB's elevation 6 becomes a 12 px black ring in launcher-*.png, which reads as a focus highlight at rest. The real app draws a shadow there; lib/ui/launcher.dart:506 sets no focus or autofocus on the FAB.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":53},"end":{"line":92},"content_hash":"4f8de258ae501318a6d5559b449e360ee45ea6ea7d0753b70d626c34d4e8e45e"},"suggested_fix":"Set debugDisableShadows = false at the start of each shot (and restore it in addTearDown) so the PNGs show what a person sees.","summary":"The shots render the New app button with a thick black outline because flutter_test disables shadows; turn shadows on for the shots","tags":["test","x4","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
